# The format of our own C, Objective-C and C++ code (C-0010 section 3): LLVM style with
# four-space indentation and a 100-column limit. It applies to src/, tests/ and tools/ only;
# the forks under external/ keep their upstream configuration (C-0010 section 4).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
